WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
<v Omar Haddad>Quick check-in on cutover prep. Ana?</v>

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
<v Ana Souza>The reconciliation report is nearly done. I'll send it tomorrow.</v>

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
<v Ana Souza>And I'll fix the duplicate policyholder records by Monday.</v>

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Ben Wu>I'll have the cutover runbook draft ready by next Friday.</v>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:41.000
<v Grace Kim>I'll get sign-off on the data residency setup from the regulator liaison by the end of the month.</v>

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
<v Omar Haddad>We also need to know by November 2 whether the call centre wants a read-only view of old claims.</v>

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.000
<v Grace Kim>I'll ask them, but no promises on timing.</v>

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.000
<v Omar Haddad>Okay. Let's look at all of this again in two weeks.</v>
